* §2.5. BV is integer and {0,1} overriding anything else; FR has neither bound;
* MI opens the lower bound; FX fixes both; and a column with no BOUNDS entry is
* non-negative, which no line says.
ROWS
 N  C
 G  R
COLUMNS
    B         C            1.0        R            1.0
    F         C            1.0        R            1.0
    M         C            1.0        R            1.0
    X         C            1.0        R            1.0
    D         C            1.0        R            1.0
BOUNDS
 BV BND       B
 FR BND       F
 MI BND       M
 FX BND       X            7.0
ENDATA
